<title>BELGIUM: Belgian unions, Renault chief meet in France.</title>
<headline>Belgian unions, Renault chief meet in France.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Workers and management of Renault's doomed Belgian plant are to meet the French carmaker's Chairman Louis Schweitzer in Beauvais, France, at 1400 GMT on Wednesday, the plant's works council said on Tuesday.</p>
